@startuml
title F5 - Settlement, Completion, Loyalty and After-sales
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam RoundCorner 15
skinparam wrapWidth 220

|System|
start
:Show receivables per Retailer (original, adjusted, confirmed, outstanding, due, overdue);

|Operator|
:Record ONE consolidated payment receipt (amount, reference, evidence);
:Select invoices and enter the applied amount per invoice;
|System|
if (Retailer named invoices?) then (no)
  :Propose order: overdue first, earliest due date, earliest created, order code;
else (yes)
endif
if (Sum applied <= receipt and each line <= outstanding?) then (yes)
  :Confirm receipt, update invoices atomically;
  :Keep any excess as Unapplied Credit;
else (no)
  :Reject allocation;
  stop
endif
note right: A confirmed receipt is never edited - use reversal + new receipt

|System|
:Completion gate - all shipments received, money settled, no open complaint;
if (Gate passed?) then (yes)
  :SO = Completed (idempotent);
  :Post Loyalty exactly once from the OrderCompleted event;
else (no)
  :Keep SO = Delivered and show the blocking reason;
endif

|Retailer|
if (Redeem reward with loyalty points?) then (yes)
  :Request redemption (points are held);
  |Admin/Operator|
  if (Approve redemption?) then (yes)
    :Approve and deliver the reward;
    |Retailer|
    :Confirm gift receipt, redemption Completed;
  else (no)
    :Reject, release the held points;
  endif
else (no)
endif

|Retailer|
if (Damaged / missing / quality issue?) then (yes)
  :Submit claim (shipment, line, batch, quantity, reason, evidence);
else (no)
  stop
endif

|Admin/Operator|
:Review claim with evidence and the final allocated price;
if (Evidence sufficient?) then (no)
  :Request more evidence (claim stays UnderReview);
else (yes)
endif
if (Decision?) then (reject)
  :Reject with reason;
  stop
else (approve)
endif
if (Resolution?) then (Replacement)
  :Create ReplacementCase and assign warehouse;
  :Approved -> Preparing -> Shipped -> Received;
  |Warehouse Keeper|
  :Stock is issued only when the replacement ships;
else (FinancialAdjustment)
  |System|
  :Adjust amount = final price x approved quantity;
  if (Money already collected beyond new amount?) then (yes)
    :Create refund obligation;
    |Admin/Operator|
    :Transfer refund outside the system, submit evidence;
    :Admin verifies or rejects evidence (resubmit on same record);
  else (no)
    :Reduce outstanding receivable;
  endif
endif

|System|
:Recalculate Loyalty target and post only the difference;
note right: Claim alone never increases stock - only a returned and accepted CustomerReturnReceipt does

|Warehouse Keeper|
:Receive returned goods, inspect quality;

|System|
:Close claim = Resolved;

|Admin/Operator|
:Review dashboards (fill rate, expiry risk, receivable aging, claims) and audit log;
stop
@enduml
